## 18. The middle tiers {#tiers}

Most of the system's work is done below the Khalifa and the national amirs, by office-bearers and missionaries who see decisions without making them. Section 15 records that the whole system is staffed by volunteer office-bearers, and each of them stands at one point where the next demand could be declined. The table sets out what each role does, what it sees, what it is asked to do and where it could refuse.

